# {{.Type}}: {{.Name}}

`{{.Name}}` provides a resource for managing log integration configurations at the organization level. This resource allows you to export organization events to an external service. Currently, OpenTelemetry is the only supported integration type.

To use this resource, the requesting Service Account or API Key must have the Organization Owner role.

